WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.300
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show,"

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.667
ladies and gentlemen.

00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:06.133
Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching at home.

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:08.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.601 --> 00:00:11.934
Well, guys, after
seven months of negotiations,

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:14.334
late Friday night,
the House finally passed

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:16.901
President Biden's
infrastructure deal.

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:19.000
Yeah. So that's
obviously -- Yeah.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.501
So, obviously --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:22.501 --> 00:00:26.033
That's probably what everyone
was talking about this weekend.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:27.601
-Big Bird is causing a stir.

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:28.834
-Big bird announced he was

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:30.334
getting vaccinated
against COVID.

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:32.234
-Big Bird got his COVID shot
over the weekend.

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:34.334
-Big Bird announces
he's been vaccinated.

00:00:34.334 --> 00:00:35.968
-Big Bird got the jab.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:40.234
-Somehow, that was
the big story this weekend --

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:43.934
Big Bird tweeting
that he got vaccinated.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:46.267
Yep.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:49.234
It was a big day,
actually, for Big Bird,

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:51.067
because immediately
after getting vaccinated,

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.834
he was signed by
the Green Bay Packers.

00:00:52.834 --> 00:00:54.033
So that is amazing.

00:00:54.033 --> 00:00:57.701
That's amazing to see
that career.

00:01:00.267 --> 00:01:01.534
Some more COVID news.

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:03.501
Today, the U.S.
lifted the travel ban on

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:06.767
vaccinated tourists
for more than 30 countries.

00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:09.000
Of course, all the airports
are going to be slammed.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.033
Flight attendants were like,

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.267
"We're going to need
more duct tape."

00:01:13.868 --> 00:01:15.400
That's right -- travelers are
thrilled to be back.

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.467
It's the first time people
ever cried tears of joy

00:01:17.467 --> 00:01:19.300
at the sight of LaGuardia.

00:01:21.834 --> 00:01:24.567
That's right -- New York City is
expecting tens of thousands

00:01:24.567 --> 00:01:28.400
of tourists, and they're all
going to walk in front of you.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.434
"Oh, wow."

00:01:31.434 --> 00:01:33.767
19 months for a travel ban
is a long time.

00:01:33.767 --> 00:01:36.567
Yep, your friend who left to
study abroad in January 2020

00:01:36.567 --> 00:01:38.601
actually came back
speaking fluent Italian.

00:01:38.601 --> 00:01:40.534
-Oh!

00:01:40.534 --> 00:01:41.868
-Well, as I mentioned,
on Friday night,

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:44.801
the House passed Biden's
infrastructure bill.

00:01:44.801 --> 00:01:46.267
The bill took forever to pass.

00:01:46.267 --> 00:01:47.801
When it was over,
they wrapped Biden in

00:01:47.801 --> 00:01:49.934
a foil marathon blanket
and gave him a medal.

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:52.501
They go...

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.968
Yeah, only 13 House Republicans
voted for the bill,

00:01:54.968 --> 00:01:56.801
while the rest said,
"We think that

00:01:56.801 --> 00:01:58.634
if you're driving over
a collapsed bridge,

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:02.133
you can just speed up
and you'll probably make it."

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:03.267
"You guys ever seen
the documentary

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:04.901
'Fast and the Furious?'"

00:02:07.934 --> 00:02:09.100
Some business news.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:11.067
Walmart just announced
that it is now using

00:02:11.067 --> 00:02:14.334
