takeout containers.

00:03:01.634 --> 00:03:03.400
-Really?
-That's what I heard.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.000
That's what I heard.
I don't know.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.968
Hey, I saw that,
in a recent Instagram post,

00:03:07.968 --> 00:03:11.434
Vin Diesel called Dwayne Johnson
his "little brother"

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:15.200
