actually got our hands on it.

00:03:20.601 --> 00:03:23.067
-Oh, my gosh!
-You guys want to hear it?

00:03:23.067 --> 00:03:26.133
[ Cheers and applause ]
I mean, this is an exclusive.

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:27.934
Let's take a listen. Vin Diesel.

00:04:11.467 --> 00:04:12.567
